
# Variable declaration file.
#
# Only those variables with possible user inputs or requiring inter-request
# savings need to be declared in this file.
#
#Each non-comment line defines a variable. Format of the line:
#
#name	allow
#
#name: name of the variable
#allow: when allow the user to override the defined value.
#       it maybe any, deny, init, config, reply.
#
#
#name	allow

status	deny
error deny
droite deny
dessin deny
dessin1 deny
dessin2 deny
dessinsol deny
border deny
equation deny
equationlin deny
eq_tex deny
mode init
coeff any
type any
x_size init
xsize1 init
xsize2 init
ysize2 init
yy_size init
xx_size init
inssize init
click_x reply
click_y reply
insdraw_size deny
a deny
b deny
A deny
B deny
pente deny
ord deny
liste deny
liste_c deny
 click_cnt deny
 reply_cnt any
 erreur deny
 miss deny
incert deny
module_score deny
err deny
